@startuml
[*] --> ChooseMode
ChooseMode --> Walking : choose walking
ChooseMode --> Cycling : choose cycling
ChooseMode --> PublicTransport : choose public transport
Walking --> Cycling : switch to cycling
Walking --> PublicTransport : switch to public transport
Walking --> [*] : complete trip
Cycling --> Walking : switch to walking
Cycling --> PublicTransport : switch to public transport
Cycling --> [*] : complete trip
PublicTransport --> Walking : switch to walking
PublicTransport --> Cycling : switch to cycling
PublicTransport --> [*] : complete trip
@enduml
